      "body": "## Gap Analysis Document — SFCC-247\n\nAttached: **SFCC-247-Gap-Analysis.docx** — *Magento Product Hierarchy vs SFCC Variation Model: Gap Analysis & Transformation Mapping*\n\n----\n\n### Summary of findings\n\nThe Magento product export (style `4673TS251`, Illuminate Fitted Blouse, Guava Seascape) was analysed against the SFCC three-level hierarchy and the project Confluence page ([Product Hierarchy — Adobe SFCC](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/247234568)).\n\n**Hierarchy mapping**\n\n|Magento|SFCC Level|Status|\n|---|---|---|\n|*(none — must be created)*|Master Product|⚠ Gap — ETL must synthesise from style code|\n|Configurable product (`4673TS251GVSCP`)|Variation Group|✅ Mapped|\n|Simple products ×6 (`4673TS251GVSCP{size`})|Variant (SKU)|✅ Mapped|\n\n**Key gaps identified (8 total)**\n\n  - **G1 (HIGH)* — No Master Product level in Magento; must be synthesised by ETL\n  - **G2 (HIGH)* — Magento configurable holds all colours under one entity; SFCC requires one Variation Group per colour\n  - **G8 (HIGH — NEW)** — SKU format mismatch between Magento (no separators, e.g. `4673TS251GVSCP0`) and the Confluence-defined SFCC convention (hyphen-delimited, e.g. `4673TS251-GVSCP-0`). **Decision required before ETL build begins.*\n  - **G3–G7* — Store-view pricing → price books, HS codes parsing, tab content model, attribute duplication, store_id mapping\n\n**Custom attribute workload** — ~47 custom attributes required across all three levels (to be registered under SFCC-26)\n\n**Transformation steps** — 7 ETL transformations documented (T1–T7), including a new step T7 for SKU format normalisation\n\n----\n\n### Recommendation for SFCC-25\n\nSFCC-25 can proceed. One open decision blocks ETL build: **agree the SFCC product ID format** (Gap G8 — hyphen-delimited vs Magento concatenation). All other gaps have defined resolutions.\n\nFull details, attribute mapping tables, and the complete Magento column inventory are in the attached document.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
        "name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
        "email": "victor.t.crisostomo@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d/0ead87b0-7d31-4296-b27b-4a7b26ac2af1/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-06T20:04:28.941+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-06T20:04:28.941+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

