  "summary": "Store Detail – Boutique Services Section",
  "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see what services are available at a boutique, so that I can make an appointment or take advantage of in-store services before or during my visit.\n\nSection on the store detail page displaying the boutique's available in-store services. Each service is presented as a tile containing a service heading, a short description, and a CTA link (e.g. \"Book an Appointment\" for Personal Styling, \"Make a Reservation\" for Click and Reserve). Services visible in the designs include: Personal Styling, In-Store Services, and Click and Reserve. The set of services displayed varies per boutique. Service tile content (heading, description, CTA label, CTA destination) is CMS-managed in Contentful. Note: the Click and Reserve CTA links to an external reservations flow — the flow itself is out of scope for this epic.\n\nSurface: PWA Kit / SFCC store detail page.\n\nOwner: SFCC/PWA Kit + Contentful.\n\nDependency: SFCC-519 (store detail page template); Contentful content model for boutique services entries must be defined.",
