      "customfield_10231": {
        "value": {
          "type": "doc",
          "version": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "1. Given a shopper is on the PDP on the ZimmermannEU or ZimmermannFR storefront, when the product has a non-empty environmentalNotes attribute, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is displayed."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2. Given a shopper is on the PDP on the ZimmermannEU or ZimmermannFR storefront, when the product has an empty or absent environmentalNotes attribute, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not rendered — no empty state, placeholder text, or fallback copy is shown."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3. Given a shopper is on the PDP on any non-EU storefront (AU, US, UK, HK, ME), when the page loads, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab does not render, regardless of whether environmentalNotes is populated on the product."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4. Given the Environmental Qualities tab is visible, when a shopper expands it, then the content displayed reflects the value of environmentalNotes as imported from AP21."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5. Given the Environmental Qualities tab is visible, when a shopper interacts with it, then it follows the same expand/collapse behaviour as the other PDP accordion tabs."
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6. Given the accordion tab order is rendered, when the Environmental Qualities tab is present, then it appears after the standard tabs (Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, Assistance)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
